  "body": "### Summary\nAs a maintainer of the link router, I want the committed corpus to keep real empty-slug topic links, so that `HFRLinkRouteCorpusTests` guards them.\n\n### Scope\nR121e (cat 22 list) as captured in c56916f (#474) holds title links `/hfr/reseauxpersosoho/FAI/sujet_39106_1.htm` (empty title slug, with and without `#bas`). The fixture kit's positional aliasing (#511, 446a349) rewrote them to `…/followed-topic-1-sujet_9800001_1.htm`, so no committed capture holds the shape and #482's router change (empty slug routed, PR #518) is covered only by hand-written URL tests.\n\nMake the anonymizer keep an empty slug empty (post id aliased, no slug invented) and re-apply it to R121e. No hand-built page (LESSONS 36).\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] The corpus holds at least one `/hfr/<cat>/<sub>/sujet_<post>_<page>.htm` link.\n- [ ] With the optional slug reverted in `HFRLinkRoute`, a corpus test fails.\n\nRefs #482",
